 "confounds": [
  "The synthetic defects are injected by this repo's own generator, not observed in the wild; the demo_kit clips carry no labels at all.",
  "Both paths decode the same cv2 frames here, so this measures the PROBES, not the two decode front ends (GRID.07 measures those).",
  "FROZEN and BLUR thresholds are not comparable with the GRID.09 full-pipeline values: different statistic units.",
  "Per-defect n is the number of generated clips (2 windows x 4 CALIB source clips), so the Wilson intervals are wide.",
  "The generator's too_dark (x0.25) and overexposed (gain 1.7 + 30) defects are milder than the shipped operating points on most source windows, so both paths miss them; that is a property of the injected strength, not a parity difference.",
  "Pooled luma percentiles use the STRICT padding detector; the features-pooling ablation is reported separately and is measurably contaminated on 16:9 sources."
 ],
